<mxCell id="t" value="A .ses FILE, END TO END" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#BE1E2D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="400" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="h" value="0x000  Signature&#xa;DiGiCo · console · .SES · format tag · CR; 26 bytes" style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#F1EFE8;strokeColor=#1B1916;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B1916;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="560" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="w" value="0x01A  Header words&#xa;session structure counts. u16 at 0x20 = offset of section 0. u16 at 0x22&#xa;= software version (1926 = V1926). Sample rate as f32 at 0x77." style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#F1EFE8;strokeColor=#1B1916;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B1916;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="86" width="560" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="o" value="0x100  Offset table&#xa;one u32 per section, zero-terminated; the last entry is the file length.&#xa;Before vB (V929) the table sits at 0x80." style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B1916;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B1916;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;strokeColor=#BE1E2D;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="147" width="560" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="y" value="0x1A1  Section types&#xa;one byte per section: db f6 fc c9 d2 d3 f3 d4 e4 d9 e8 ea ec ed dd cf f8&#xa;f9 fa eb e2 d0 e3 e5 e1 ee. Find sections by type, never by position:&#xa;older revisions list fewer." style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B1916;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B1916;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;strokeColor=#BE1E2D;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="208" width="560" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s0" value="entry 0   section 0&#xa;session name, u16-length string" style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B1916;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B1916;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="284" width="560" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s1" value="entry 1   db  presets&#xa;the preset library: whole objects with a name, category, sub-label and&#xa;timestamp" style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B1916;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B1916;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="330" width="560" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
